sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant NT as NetworkedTournament
    participant G as Game
    participant R as ReplayRecorder
    participant L as commands: List~ReplayCommand~
    participant S as ReplayStore
    participant FS as FileSystem

    Note over NT,R: Setup (inside NetworkedTournament.start())
    NT->>R: new ReplayRecorder(tournamentId, store)
    NT->>G: addObserver(recorder)

    Note over G,L: Per-round event flow
    loop each round of each game
        G->>R: onMoveMade(MoveEvent)
        R->>R: new MoveCommand(round, names, labels, payoffs)
        R->>L: append(moveCommand)
    end

    Note over G,L: End of a single game
    G->>R: onGameOver(GameResult)
    R->>R: new GameEndCommand(winner, totals)
    R->>L: append(gameEndCommand)

    Note over G,FS: End of tournament — flush
    G->>R: onTournamentOver(TournamentResult)
    R->>R: new TournamentEndCommand(standings)
    R->>L: append(tournamentEndCommand)
    R->>S: save(tournamentId, commands)
    S->>FS: write {tournamentId}-{timestamp}.replay
    FS-->>S: ok
    S-->>R: void
